        "text": "Our audit covers technical site health, Core Web Vitals, keyword opportunity analysis, competitor benchmarking, and a prioritised action plan. It is a diagnostic report, not a sales document. You receive a written deliverable you can execute internally or with our team."
      }
    },
    {
